          "snippet": {
            "line": 636,
            "text": "noncomputable def timeResidual (C h : ℝ) (f : ℝ → ℝ) (t z r : ℝ) : ℝ :=\n  heatAmplitude C (1 + h) t r * deriv f (Real.log (SimilarityProfile.X h (radiusPoint t r z))) /\n    timeDenominator h t z"
